{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18389","headline":"赋得春风扇微和 · 崔立之","name":"赋得春风扇微和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"时令忽已变，年光俄又春。\n高低惠风入，远近芳气新。\n靡靡才偃草，泠泠不动尘。\n温和乍扇物，煦妪偏感人。\n去出桂林漫，来过蕙圃频。\n晨辉正澹荡，披拂长相亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔立之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18389.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18389","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}